      <ul><li><a href="https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxNamRLRjFoRmhTMFJKcXZHaG1FUDdrZ3RnUjRfNlB6d3N1YlRfdkpNb2Vyb3VyQUtXMHB6ZFlKS3hXYThQVnU5ZEdXMEdOM3oxRnRqY2lBLVFpYlBlR1FiRm85UV9HajhHLW93VV9hR19JQ1Q0bVFfTExZTndKNWtlMWVRR1RSOEw4ZS1tTW82SzVUUG1qZjVOUFRjSkVsWFRjNHFRNk0xYnVfWEVZMHJQVXNIcUZwczY4dTV2Yi10NG10bDQ?oc=5" rel="noopener">Education (aggregate)</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
