      <ul><li><a href="https://www.crictracker.com/cricket-news/dan-lawrence-called-up-as-jos-buttler-misses-oval-decider-with-hamstring-injury/" rel="noopener">Crictracker</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
