      <ul><li><a href="https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPcmVHRm9oUUQwUXIzaGgzYi1SQzNfUlUxWFBJM1B1eTRQTDRHMW9US1h6dmV0MWkyMThicDZRSVVieTJoX2JuU0paUEozSEluUGhyRlRoZzA5UVVsUkNKX2JoQWtIb2ZfOVlxNFpiZmlkeUtyMHg1d0l2VzQ5Z3kwMHV3MU9fZk5vNHU3SlY5TmZpQnlxX1pIblBfM3lEZHkxQ3BGNDl6N25OTjAzM3BaUFJ0YXoydVA3NmZv?oc=5" rel="noopener">Defence (aggregate)</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
