    </div>
  </div>
  <nav class="catrow"><span class="catgrp"><b>News</b><a href="/category/national">national</a><a href="/category/world">world</a><a href="/category/defence">defence</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Money</b><a href="/category/business">business</a><a href="/category/finance">finance</a><a href="/category/education">education</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Sports</b><a href="/category/sports">sports</a><a href="/category/cricket">cricket</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Culture</b><a href="/category/entertainment">entertainment</a><a href="/category/positive">positive</a><a href="/category/funny">funny</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Life</b><a href="/category/science">science</a><a href="/category/environment">environment</a><a href="/category/space">space</a><a href="/category/health">health</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Tech</b><a href="/category/tech">tech</a><a href="/category/ai">ai</a></span></nav></div><div class="gtr"><span>Read in your language:</span><div id="google_translate_element"></div></div><div class="wrap"><main id="content"><p class="crumb"><a href="/">← Front page</a> · <a href="/archive">Archive</a> · <a href="/category/education">education</a></p>
     <article class="story single" data-beat="education">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">EDUCATION</span> · Education (aggregate) · 2026-09-25 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>IIM Jammu to Establish Satellite Campus in Leh Following MoU with Ladakh Administration</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#education</span> <span>#IIM Jammu</span> <span>#Ladakh</span> <span>#higher education</span></div>
       <p>The Indian Institute of Management (IIM) Jammu has formalized an agreement with the Ladakh administration to establish a satellite campus in Leh. This significant development, reported by The Times of India, marks a strategic move to expand higher education opportunities and management expertise in the Union Territory of Ladakh. The Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) signifies a collaborative effort to bring premier management education closer to the region's students and professionals.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-25/iim-jammu-to-establish-satellite-campus-in-leh-following-mou.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The establishment of a satellite campus by a prestigious institution like IIM Jammu is expected to have a transformative impact on the educational landscape of Leh and wider Ladakh. It will provide local students with access to world-class management programs without having to relocate to distant cities, thereby promoting regional talent development. Furthermore, the presence of an IIM campus could stimulate local entrepreneurship and contribute to the economic growth of the region by fostering skilled professionals and innovative business practices.</p><p>The MoU underscores the commitment of IIM Jammu to national development and the Ladakh administration's vision for enhancing educational infrastructure. This partnership is poised to create new avenues for learning, research, and professional growth in a strategically important region. The initiative is a step towards integrating Ladakh more closely with the national mainstream of higher education and professional development.</p><p>What to watch: Further details on the campus development timeline and program offerings.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article accurately describes the MoU between IIM Jammu and the Ladakh administration based on the provided source.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
