       <h1>India Adds Gold and Silver in Shooting at Asian Games 2026, Medal Tally Reaches 19</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Asian Games 2026</span> <span>#Shooting</span> <span>#India</span></div>
       <p>India experienced a successful Day 6 at the Asian Games 2026 in Aichi-Nagoya, securing two additional medals in shooting events. This double delight, comprising a gold and a silver, further boosted the nation's overall medal tally to 19.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-25/india-adds-gold-and-silver-in-shooting-at-asian-games-2026-m.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The gold medal was clinched in the highly competitive 10m air pistol mixed team event. This victory marked a significant achievement for the Indian contingent, showcasing their prowess in precision shooting. The mixed team format often presents unique challenges, requiring synchronized effort and consistent performance from both participants.</p><p>Following this success, India also secured a silver medal in the men's 50m rifle 3 positions team event. This result added another valuable medal to India's growing collection at the Games. The 50m rifle 3 positions is a demanding discipline, testing athletes across kneeling, prone, and standing positions, and the team's performance underscored their collective skill and training.</p><p>These latest additions from the shooting range have propelled India's total medal count to 19, demonstrating a strong showing across various disciplines at the Asian Games 2026 hosted in Aichi-Nagoya. The consistent performance highlights the depth of talent within the Indian sports ecosystem.</p><p>What to watch: India's continued performance in ongoing and upcoming events across different sports.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article accurately summarizes the provided source information regarding the Asian Games.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://sports.ndtv.com/othersports/asian-games-2026-live-updates-day-6-india-medal-tally-gold-silver-bronze-results-aichi-nagoya-japan-live-news-12094355#publisher=newsstand" rel="noopener">NDTV Sports</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
