       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · News18 India · 2026-09-25 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Shillong Teer Results Announced for September 25, 2026</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Shillong Teer</span> <span>#Lottery</span> <span>#Archery</span> <span>#Northeast India</span></div>
       <p>The latest winning numbers for several popular Teer games, including Shillong Teer, Juwai Teer, Khanapara Teer, Shillong Morning Teer, and Night Teer, have been released for September 25, 2026. Participants eagerly awaiting the outcomes of these archery-based lotteries can now check their tickets against the official results.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-25/shillong-teer-results-announced-for-september-25-2026.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Teer is a distinctive form of legal betting predominantly played in the Northeastern states of India. Unlike conventional lotteries, its results are derived from an archery competition where a specific number of arrows are shot at a target. The winning numbers typically correspond to the last two digits of the total number of arrows that successfully hit the target in various rounds. This unique format blends traditional sports with a lottery system, deeply embedding it within the local culture and economy.</p><p>Today's announcement provides the results for multiple draws conducted across the day and into the evening. These daily declarations are critical for participants who place their bets, offering the chance to win based on their predictions of the arrow counts. The results are widely disseminated through various local channels and digital platforms, ensuring accessibility for all players.</p><p>The consistent and transparent publication of these daily results is vital for maintaining the integrity and popularity of the Teer games. It underscores the regulated framework within which these traditional forms of entertainment and wagering operate, providing a daily focal point for many in the region.</p><p>What to watch: The continued daily release of Teer results remains a significant event for its dedicated participant base.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article provides a accurate summary of the source material provided.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.news18.com/india/shillong-teer-result-today-september-25-2026-winning-numbers-10350158.html" rel="noopener">News18 India</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/shillong/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Shillong</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-09-25/shillong-teer-results-announced-for-september-25-2026" data-title="Shillong Teer Results Announced for September 25, 2026"><b>Share:</b>
