      <ul><li><a href="https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPTWJlMUoyWENPTFRMZ2hzNG92LWJBNTFBMzZNck5Pci1JczB2Yk5uZWFCM0xHaHRoZHJJMGlVZ1JQSVV0d2tsWTBuNk5acDJ2YzdsQmRQNGVQNjVjWU1LOGl0dWxfZHVUaU00d0JVUjNSWDEzNWJoNHVQRWFDbmFpQjAzb3FvRW9NNWVXajRsdHpITmNhczJDTnpJMm05UEUzLThR?oc=5" rel="noopener">Education (aggregate)</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
